    <string name="position_description">In a bottom corner with gesture navigation, the system takes over a swipe that starts in a strip along the bottom of the screen, and Recents opens. Raise the trigger until a swipe up from it stays with Fan. Touching it opens the sheet, and a long press shows the actions: Back, Home, Recents, these settings and a few system actions.</string>
