    <string name="sheet_title_section">Fan layout</string>
    <string name="rows_description">Tap a part of the fan in the preview, or in the list below it, to select it, then use the controls under the list to change it. The grips along the bottom and side edges of the preview are the margins between the screen edges and the fan. The corner ring holds just the app that is open now (and is empty on the home screen); you can change its width, or hide the app and keep only the space. Long press that app, like any other, to open its App Info page. Ring 1 is the next one out. Icons fill ring 1 first, then the next ring out. Each ring sizes its icons to its width. The sheet lists as many apps as all the rings hold. A ring\'s width is how far it reaches along the screen edge; the widths add up to the sheet\'s size.</string>
